[b]Project Zomboid Optimiser[/b] is a comprehensive performance, framerate, and desync optimization suite engineered specifically for Project Zomboid Build 42 and Build 41 (Singleplayer and Multiplayer).

It dynamically mitigates game engine bottlenecks, reduces memory fragmentation, eliminates combat micro-hitches, optimizes vehicle streaming, and includes an in-game [b]F10 Control Center[/b] with 7 dedicated configuration tabs.

